# Optional. Everything works without this file.
#
# With no key, Urby runs entirely on the product rules in src/recommend.js and the
# keyword/postcode fallbacks in src/urby.js. Set a key and she additionally rephrases
# her acknowledgements and the explanation — she still cannot choose a plan or invent
# a price. See "How Urby stays credible" in README.md.
#
# Load it however you prefer, e.g.:
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... npm start
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Which model the wording layer uses.
# URBY_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# How long to wait before falling back to the rules, in milliseconds.
# Keep this short: a demo must never hang waiting on a model.
# URBY_TIMEOUT_MS=3500

# PORT=3000
